            <p class="text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
              With debt gone and emergencies covered, start investing. Retirement accounts first (tax advantages), then taxable accounts. Consistency beats timing.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

