        </dt>
        <dd id="faq-answer-2" class="faq-answer" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-2" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner pb-6 pt-0" itemprop="text">
            <p class="text-base text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
              Life happens. The key is to pick up where you left off without guilt. Most tracking apps let you backdate entries. If you miss a few days, add what you remember and move on. Consistency over time matters more than daily perfection. A rough estimate is better than no data at all.
            </p>
